# DECOMPOSE — gates (checklist)

**Канон (проза/таблицы):** `workflow-decompose.mdc` · behavior-first · legacy-fallback-cleanup  
**Артефакт:** `memory-bank/back/plan/<plan_id>/yaml/decompose-index.yaml` + `yaml/steps/sNN-*.yaml`
**`<plan_id>` HARD:** stem plan **со descriptive slug** (`plan/<plan_id>/md/plan.md`) — @.cursor/rules/shared/epic-scoped-paths.mdc §Folder naming.
**Anti-minimal:** @.cursor/rules/shared/_lean/anti-minimal-done.mdc — sole-path FR → wire→enforce→purge; boundary sNN: `wire_complete_required: true` + negative verify

## PASS checklist

1. Plan из `load_now` / `plan-<id>`; L3 → все shards при наличии
2. Index: Requirements coverage · Stages coverage · Outcome map · Replacement cleanup (A|B|C|**I**)
3. Каждый AC+/AC−/BN-*/FR/NFR → sNN или `out_of_scope`+`follow_up` **в queue**; FR nouns verbatim ∈ `produces`/`files`; applicable `BN-*` → targeted verify (не только happy-path)
4. Covered row ⇒ measurable `verify` (не map-only / не surrogate-only для product FR)
4a. **Test scope (HARD):** каждый `sNN` содержит только targeted `verify` по своему `files`/`delta`; full pytest suite в shard запрещён и передаётся **BACK QA**. Канон: @.cursor/rules/shared/test-timeout.mdc §DECOMPOSE / IMPLEMENT boundary
5. Titles outcome-first; matrix/lifecycle/existing-services → отдельные sNN **только при отдельном outcome** (не micro-ladder schema→CLI→wire)
5a. **Level cap + Granularity:** index содержит `level: L1|L2|L3` + `sNN_cap` (1|2|3); `sNN_count ≤ sNN_cap`; **FORBIDDEN** L4 · Effort probe · добивание до cap; audit-хвост / docs+Kind I / core+CLI — сливать. shared/workflow-behavior-first.mdc §3a
6. Каждый `sNN`: `epic-decompose/v1` + `role: back` + list `as_built`/`delta` + `deletes` + `plan_contract` + `skills.code_surface` + Core(4) ∪ situational ≤6 (или `omit_justification` на каждый omitted default)
6a. **Skills HARD:** `code_surface ≠ docs` ⇒ `impl` не `[]` + Core(4); surface defaults ∈ impl|omit_justification; template empty-impl = FAIL; DECOMPOSE = **copy paths** only (@.cursor/rules/shared/_lean/decompose-skills-load.mdc) — Read тел SKILL на DECOMPOSE = incomplete
7. Brownfield ≠ n/a → `deletes` + `*-legacy-fallback-purge` (+ Kind I)
8. CLI: `validate-decompose-tree` exit 0 (incl. skills gate) · `validate-traceability` **CRITICAL=0**
9. Next = **IMPLEMENT** (`@verify-decompose` уже закрыл полный closure) — **FORBIDDEN** deferred second gate
10. Goal/NFR не сжаты до infra-only

