- Добивание пустых sNN до cap / L4 / Effort probe → incomplete (`effort_cap_violation`)
- CRITICAL>0 · schema ≠ `epic-decompose/v1` · **skills:** empty impl на code · Core partial · situational unjustified / >6 / вне allowlist · Read тел Core/situational SKILL на DECOMPOSE
